    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Alex",
      "key": "winter_Wed",
      "field": null,
      "source": "People stay indoors a lot during the winter, and do boring stuff.$s#$e#Maybe if I read a book I'd be less bored... nah.",
      "translation": "Lidé v zimě hodně sedí doma a dělají nudné věci.$s#$e#Možná bych se u knihy tolik nenudil... Ale ne.",
      "sourceSHA256": "255b1e1c86aaa124bce7e57a21b764a53f5dcbf60060c767cbbe82590244b72d",
      "translationSHA256": "f2054340361bf49550f9136cfbe1739f1e5c9724485fd506f6595de584daac34",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Alex",
      "key": "winter_Thu",
      "field": null,
      "source": "When I turn pro, I'll be so rich that I'll get a vacation home in the tropics.#$e#Then I won't have to deal with these boring winters.",
      "translation": "Až se stanu profesionálem, budu tak bohatý, že si pořídím rekreační dům v tropech.#$e#Pak už nebudu muset snášet tyhle nudné zimy.",
      "sourceSHA256": "4ac934c22bfdb3e3f3da258540bfd7b75f19567e36eabfb295864d7c1c1afa4a",
      "translationSHA256": "f4ad4a7af65c480b0181170e13f9a56b736bb9c0f3153f754600e857b2fa325c",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Alex",
      "key": "winter_Fri",
      "field": null,
      "source": "You came all the way through the snow to see me?#$e#I guess that makes sense.",
      "translation": "Taková cesta sněhem jen kvůli mně?#$e#Vlastně to dává smysl.",
      "sourceSHA256": "c419a7312d85eb87966dc3d98306b77ed9de9579fb41f31468993945c94b79c1",
      "translationSHA256": "13010fac27d1b57f0f8208f39fed20323a9a105c07072a19ff1b98612e152fc8",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Alex",
      "key": "winter_Sat",
      "field": null,
      "source": "There's some weird people living in this town.#$e#...like that guy Sebastian. Why does he wear black all the time?#$e#I don't get it.",
      "translation": "V tomhle městě žijí nějací divní lidé.#$e#...Třeba ten Sebastian. Proč pořád nosí černou?#$e#Nechápu to.",
      "sourceSHA256": "21075c3e7876c60cb1a46e8fcc1e8c3a3523a9be47eb1d8cf0b3b2392466f6a3",
      "translationSHA256": "7640c634a6d8730332a0801ed5c5b951132e9dff8614da59bbd5a575b666be67",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Alex",
      "key": "winter_Sun",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hey, the gridball game is on today!#$e#This might be my favorite day of the week.",
      "translation": "Hej, dnes dávají zápas v gridballu!#$e#Tohle je možná můj nejoblíbenější den v týdnu.",
      "sourceSHA256": "0c0311ea9fb7e8b26075e04c7cceece4da3bf969289c4beb12c1bffe785f9896",
      "translationSHA256": "a8785806a52e32ccad97a3dab2dd206238ac2ff2c9c7d2876b41a9fef2c98c94",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
