    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Alex",
      "key": "winter_Tue4_inlaw_Haley",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I'll admit... I was a little jealous when you and Haley got married. But, hey... It's a chance for me to learn something new about myself.$9",
      "translation": "Přiznávám... Po tvé svatbě s Haley jsem trochu žárlil. Ale co... Je to pro mě příležitost dozvědět se o sobě něco nového.$9",
      "sourceSHA256": "63dcd15cb24c94b49721a11e6c383644de81f892ce0466fd5d0074799bed205a",
      "translationSHA256": "d7db90cd96d7c79f0d1e720113b05a87fe4b5ab5cc7962fd8928dbfd15555206",
      "reviewChecks": [
